            <div xml:id="d224">

                <pb facs="0409" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg339"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Campbell</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 11.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 27, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    despatch of December 13, No. 6.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * *</p>
                <p>Your proceedings at Vera Cruz, Tampico, and Brownsville, as therein related, are
                    approved.</p>
                <p>The information which you have given me is appreciated. With a reservation, which
                    I may take a more convenient occasion to mention, the President approves of the
                    notes of which a copy is appended to your despatch.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD,</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis D. Campbell</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
